50	        `"${s.hostname}" (customer ${s.user.email}) shows RUNNING but SSH auth failed: ${msg}. This usually means the stored root password no longer matches the guest after an interrupted provision/reinstall. Check via Impersonate or the console, then resync/reset the password from the server's admin page.`,
